Design notes:
  - config.Settings (DEP-2 variables, plus ACCOUNTABLE_RELOAD per E-2) and one Clock (SystemClock / FixedClock).
  - Middleware order: request ID and logging (outermost), security, unexpected errors (innermost).
  - Errors: AppError, validation (422 with one message per field, 400 for malformed JSON), HTTP errors,
    locked database -> 503 busy, anything else -> 500 internal with the stack trace only in the log.
  - The engine uses hide_parameters=True so a database error never puts field values in the log (SEC-8).
  - FastAPI's /docs, /redoc and /openapi.json are off: Swagger UI loads from a CDN (R2).
